  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a7af9db073720344495bd03aa6455d5c, type: 3}
  m_Name: Labirithm 1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NoteData
  title: 
  content: "Not every word must be woven into the design,\r\nBut the Motherland is
    heard in the branches' sigh,\r\nWhere heritage, through time, sends forth a verdict's
    line\r\nTo traditions \u2014 and from her the roots stretch out and twine.\r\n\r\nAccept
    my Gift \u2014 not a burden, but a gentle light,\r\nIn the partnership of hands,
    a union is born.\r\nAn exchange without words \u2014 and soon you are warm and
    bright,\r\nWhen you lose all count of moments lost and torn.\r\n\r\nAgain I bear
    my Gift through the clamor of the rain,\r\nPartnership is harder than steel in
    the hour of need.\r\nA union is no vow, but fate \u2014 a leader's worthy domain,\r\nWhere
    no empty words are scattered as seed.\r\n\r\nProtection is a shield, but the
    upward surge \u2014 a dream,\r\nSupport is firmament where they build, not burn.\r\nAnd
    in this vertical, beauty strikes its gleam,\r\nWhere the roots of past years
    make the future return."
